# ============================================================================
#  example_joseph_hebron.adv
#  Komplett exempel pa ASCII-aventyrsformatet for MyEsp-OnTheRoad.
#  Detta ar den VERKLIGA Hebron-kartan (Jakobs lager) ur Josef-kapitlet
#  (1 Mosebok 37), uttryckt i authoringformatet. Jamfor med kallkoden:
#    components/otr_engine/otr_maps_joseph.cpp  (JOSEPH_CAMP_ROWS)
#    components/otr_story/otr_story_joseph.cpp   (jakob, josef, ruben)
#
#  Se docs/AUTHORING_ADVENTURES.md for full teckenlegend och regler.
#  Rader som borjar med '#' ar kommentarer. Tomma rader ignoreras
#  (utom inuti @map, dar varje rad ar en kartrad).
# ============================================================================

@meta
id: joseph_camp
world: 4                 # WorldId (1..255). Josef = 4 (WORLD_JOSEPH)
map_id: 4                # Stabilt kart-id for sparfiler (kampen = 4)
name.sv: Jakobs lager
name.en: Jacob's camp
desc.sv: Hebron. Hamta den brokiga manteln hos Jakob och ge den till Josef.
desc.en: Hebron. Fetch the ornate robe from Jacob and give it to Joseph.

# --- Spelregler (motsvarar struct Otr::Rules, se otr_world.h) ----------------
@rules
start_energy: 8          # Energi vid start (och forsta maxvardet)
energy_cap: 20           # Hur hogt max-energin kan vaxa (hjartan)
lives: infinite          # "infinite" eller ett tal 1..9
lava_damage: 3           # Energi per lava-steg utan dräktladdning
mine_damage: 4           # Energi per mina
suit_base_steps: 3       # Dräktladdningar vid upplockning ...
suit_per_extra_max: 1    # ... + sa har manga per permanent extra energienhet
potion_default: 2        # Energi en trolldryck ger utan eget varde
heart_default: 1         # Max-energi ett hjarta ger utan eget varde
fog: false               # true = minsvepar-varld (marken dold tills avtackt)

# --- Kartan (40 bred x 30 hog). Exakt ett 'S' (start) och minst ett 'X' ------
# Siffror 1..9 = talbara personer (kopplas till @npc via "num").
# Teckenlegend: se @legend langst ner och AUTHORING_ADVENTURES.md.
@map
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
T...................X..................T
T......................................T
T......................................T
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT3TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
T......................................T
T......................................T
T.......###.................###........T
T.......#_#.................#_#...+....T
T.......#_#...T.............#_#........T
T.........1.............T..............T
T......................................T
T.................,~~,.................T
T.........b.......,~~,.....b...........T
T.................,,,,.................T
T....TT..........................T.....T
T......*............2....b........T....T
T..............T.......................T
T......................................T
T......................................T
T.......###.................###........T
T.......#_#.................#_#........T
T.......#_#.......###.......#_#........T
T.................#_#..................T
T.....Q.......b...#_#..................T
T...........T.................T........T
T.....S................................T
T......................................T
T......................................T
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT

# ============================================================================
#  STORY
#  Deklarera forst alla namn (flaggor, raknare, foremal, uppdrag). Varje namn
#  som anvands i cond/effects MASTE vara deklarerat (validate() kraver det).
# ============================================================================

@flags
met_jakob
robe_given
josef_ready
met_ruben

@counters
trust

# foremal:  id : namn.sv : namn.en
@items
robe : Brokig mantel : Ornate robe

# uppdrag:  id : namn.sv : namn.en
@quests
deliver_robe : Manteln till Josef : The robe for Joseph
dotan : Mot Dotan : To Dothan

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  NPC: Jakob (siffra 1 pa kartan)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@npc jakob
name: Jakob | Jacob
look: 0                  # sprite-/portrattindex i UI:t
num: 1                   # matchar siffran '1' i @map

# Flera noder kan dela id: forsta vars villkor stammer anvands. Sa "minns" en
# person: variant 1 (!met_jakob), variant 2 (uppdrag aktivt), variant 3 (klart),
# variant 4 (utan villkor = alltid, fallback).
@node jakob.start
cond: !met_jakob
speaker: jakob
ref: 1 Mos 37:3
effects: set met_jakob; give robe; quest deliver_robe active
text.sv: Du maste vara den resande. Jag ar Jakob. Min son Josef ar sjutton och mitt hjartas ogonsten. Jag har sytt en brokig mantel at honom - ta den och ge honom den, ar du snall.
text.en: You must be the traveller. I am Jacob. My son Joseph is seventeen, the apple of my eye. I made him an ornate robe - take it and give it to him, please.
choice: Sa klart, var ar Josef? | Of course, where is Joseph? => jakob.where
choice: Varfor just Josef? | Why Joseph especially? => jakob.why
choice: Hej da! | Bye! => END

@node jakob.start
cond: quest:deliver_robe=active
speaker: jakob
text.sv: Har du inte gett manteln till Josef an? Han brukar sta nere vid farhagen mitt i lagret.
text.en: Haven't you given Joseph the robe yet? He's usually down by the sheep pen in the middle of camp.
choice: Jag gar dit nu. | I'll go now. => END
choice: Var star han? | Where is he? => jakob.where

@node jakob.start
cond: robe_given
speaker: jakob
text.sv: Tack for att du gav Josef manteln. Se sa fin den ar pa honom! Hans broder... ja, de ser den ocksa.
text.en: Thank you for giving Joseph the robe. See how fine it looks on him! His brothers... yes, they see it too.
choice: Vad menar du? | What do you mean? => jakob.why
choice: Hej da! | Bye! => END

@node jakob.start
speaker: jakob
text.sv: Valkommen i mitt lager, resande. Ma du vandra i frid.
text.en: Welcome to my camp, traveller. May you walk in peace.
choice: Hej da! | Bye! => END

@node jakob.where
speaker: jakob
text.sv: Mitt i lagret, vid farhagen. Ge honom manteln fran mig.
text.en: In the middle of camp, by the sheep pen. Give him the robe from me.
choice: Tack, Jakob. | Thanks, Jacob. => END

@node jakob.why
speaker: jakob
ref: 1 Mos 37:4
effects: add trust 1
text.sv: Josef foddes pa min alderdom. Jag vet att jag skammer bort honom. Hans aldre broder blir avundsjuka - men ett far-hjarta rar man inte over.
text.en: Joseph was born in my old age. I know I spoil him. His older brothers grow jealous - but a father's heart has a will of its own.
choice: Jag forstar. | I understand. => END

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  NPC: Josef (siffra 2 pa kartan)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@npc josef
name: Josef | Joseph
look: 1
num: 2

@node josef.start
cond: robe_given
speaker: josef
ref: 1 Mos 37:7
text.sv: Tack for manteln! Jag drommde nagot i natt: vi band karvar pa akern, och min karve reste sig medan era bugade. Konstigt, va?
text.en: Thanks for the robe! I had a dream last night: we were binding sheaves, and mine stood up while yours bowed down to it. Strange, right?
choice: Beratta mer. | Tell me more. => josef.dream2
choice: Hej da! | Bye! => END

# En valbar rad kan ha villkor (??) och effekter (!!). Raden ges bara om
# villkoret stammer; effekterna tillampas nar man valjer den.
@node josef.start
cond: has:robe
speaker: josef
text.sv: Ah, en mantel! Ar den till mig? Fran far? Far jag se!
text.en: Oh, a robe! Is it for me? From Father? Let me see!
choice: Har, den ar din. | Here, it's yours. => josef.getrobe ?? has:robe !! take robe; set robe_given; set josef_ready; quest deliver_robe done; sound quest
choice: Hej da! | Bye! => END

@node josef.start
speaker: josef
text.sv: Hej! Jag ar Josef. Mina broder vaktar hjorden, men far vill ha mig nara sig. Har du nagot till mig?
text.en: Hi! I'm Joseph. My brothers tend the flock, but Father likes to keep me close. Do you have something for me?
choice: Inte riktigt an. | Not quite yet. => END

@node josef.getrobe
speaker: josef
ref: 1 Mos 37:7
effects: add trust 1
text.sv: Wow, titta pa alla farger! Tack! Nu kan jag beratta: jag drommde att vi band karvar, och min karve stod rak medan era bugade for den.
text.en: Wow, look at all the colours! Thank you! Now I can tell you: I dreamed we bound sheaves, and mine stood upright while yours bowed to it.
choice: Beratta mer. | Tell me more. => josef.dream2
choice: Sag inte det till broderna! | Don't tell your brothers! => josef.warn

@node josef.dream2
speaker: josef
ref: 1 Mos 37:9
text.sv: Jag drommde en gang till: solen, manen och elva stjarnor bugade for mig. Aven far hojde pa ogonbrynen at den.
text.en: I had another dream: the sun, the moon and eleven stars bowed to me. Even Father raised an eyebrow at that one.
choice: Vad kan det betyda? | What could it mean? => josef.warn
choice: Hej da! | Bye! => END

@node josef.warn
speaker: josef
ref: 1 Mos 37:13
text.sv: Du har ratt, jag borde halla drommarna for mig sjalv. Men de kanns sa verkliga! Far vill att jag gar till broderna i Dotan. Prata med Ruben forst.
text.en: You're right, I should keep the dreams to myself. But they feel so real! Father wants me to go to my brothers in Dothan. Talk to Reuben first.
choice: Jag pratar med Ruben. | I'll talk to Reuben. => END

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  NPC: Ruben (siffra 3) - blockerar gapet i tradraden norrut
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@npc ruben
name: Ruben | Reuben
look: 2
num: 3

@node ruben.start
cond: josef_ready & !met_ruben
speaker: ruben
ref: 1 Mos 37:21
effects: set met_ruben; quest dotan active
text.sv: Sa far skickar lillebror till oss i Dotan? I den dar manteln? Broderna kommer inte gilla det. Men jag vakar over honom. Kom - jag kliver at sidan, vagen norrut ar din.
text.en: So Father sends the little one to us in Dothan? In that robe? The brothers won't like it. But I'll watch over him. Come - I'll step aside, the way north is yours.
choice: Tack, Ruben. | Thanks, Reuben. => ruben.moves

@node ruben.start
cond: met_ruben
speaker: ruben
text.sv: Vagen till Dotan ligger oppen norrut. Ga varsamt - och hall ett oga pa Josef.
text.en: The road to Dothan lies open to the north. Tread carefully - and keep an eye on Joseph.
choice: Hej da! | Bye! => END

@node ruben.start
speaker: ruben
text.sv: Jag ar Ruben, aldst av broderna. Ge Josef manteln fran far forst - jag slapper ingen norrut forran han ar redo for Dotan.
text.en: I'm Reuben, the eldest. Give Joseph the robe from Father first - I let no one north until he's ready for Dothan.
choice: Jag fixar det. | I'll sort it out. => END

# En nod utan "speaker:" ar en berattarnod. Effekten "world npc_move 3 18 6"
# flyttar person 3 (Ruben) till rutan (18,6) sa gapet oppnas.
@node ruben.moves
ref: 1 Mos 37:21
effects: world npc_move 3 18 6; sound quest
text.sv: Ruben stiger at sidan. Gapet i tradraden oppnar sig, och stigen mot Dotan stracker sig norrut.
text.en: Reuben steps aside. The gap in the trees opens, and the path to Dothan stretches north.
choice: Mot Dotan! | To Dothan! => END

# ============================================================================
#  @legend - informativ referens (parsas ej; teckentabellen ar inbyggd).
# ============================================================================
@legend
. = gras (gangbar)          , = sand           _ = stengolv        # = vagg
% = sprucken vagg (2 slag)  T = trad           ~ = vatten          ^ = lava
o = tryckplatta             = = grind          Q = checkpoint      X = utgang (mal)
S = start                   1..9 = person      b = buske           * + $ = adelsten
R r = sten (knuffa)         c C = lada (sla)   k K = nyckel        D = last dorr
B = bat                     p = trolldryck     h = hjarta          u = skyddsdrakt
l = extra liv               m = dold mina
